---
/**
 * QuoteBlock — cita ceremonial sobre fondo sage con patrón de estrellas.
 */
---
<section class="quote">
  <img class="quote__pattern" src="/assets/pattern-stars-sage.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="quote__inner">
    <img class="quote__star" src="/assets/star.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
    <blockquote class="quote__text">
      “La justicia es la constante y perpetua voluntad de dar a cada quien lo que le corresponde.”
    </blockquote>
    <div class="quote__cite">ULPIANO · DIGESTO, 1, 1, 10</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote { position: relative; background: var(--pj-mist); padding: var(--space-9) var(--space-6); overflow: hidden; }
  .quote__pattern { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: .7; }
  .quote__inner { position: relative; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .quote__star { height: 40px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-6); }
  .quote__text {
    font: 400 var(--fs-40)/1.25 var(--font-display);
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -.005em;
  }
  .quote__cite {
    font: 400 var(--fs-12)/1 var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: .22em;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .quote__text { font-size: var(--fs-28); } }
</style>
